	(text_box "f=1/(2pi*sqrt(R1R2 C1C2))\nQ=(sqrt(R2/R1))/(sqrt(C1/C2 + C2/C1))\n\nQ is Quality Factor, high Q means long resonance\n\nTe = Q/pif to decay to 1/e amplitude"
